discussion_comments.comment_body:
Right now the default is `allow-scripts allow-same-origin`, so the MCP app runs under an ancestor iframe that does not allow forms. Even though the inner app iframe includes `allow-forms`, Chromium applies sandbox restrictions from ancestor iframes too, so form submissions are blocked.

So we need keep `allow-forms` in the default.  eg: 
`iframe.setAttribute('sandbox', sandbox.permissions || 'allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms');

